    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24953" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-κλάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>break in twain,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξα . . χερσὶ διακλάσσας</span> (
				Ep.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κλάσας</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.216
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαθρύπτομαι, διακλᾶσθαι
					Ἰωνικῶς</span>
			
			<i>practise soft</i> Ionian airs, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				163
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακεκλασμένος</span>”
				<i>enervated,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Demon.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὄμμα</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.58
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακλώμενοι ῥυθμοί,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρώδεις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				43
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Comp.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
